        "computer_connected": true,
        "enabled": false,
        "running": false,
        "code": "app_not_found"
      },
      "expect": "accept",
      "reason": "An action on an app the node does not run is an answer, not a refusal, and it carries the flags like every control body does: enabled and running are false because there is nothing to show, not because they are absent."
    },
